data.content:
I've built a modern, responsive consent form using a React component structure within a single standalone HTML document.

### Key Features:
*   **React Structure**: Uses `App` and `CheckboxField` components powered by React and Babel CDNs.
*   **Modern Design**: Utilizes a clean card layout with a professional Indigo color palette, crisp typography (Inter), and smooth hover effects.
*   **Accessibility**: Includes `aria-describedby` to link the checkbox with its helper text and uses semantic labels.
*   **Compliance**: The checkbox is marked as `required` and wrapped in a `.form-field` div as requested.

The solution is contained entirely in `index.html`.

```html
<!-- index.html -->
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Join our community</title>
    <!-- React and Babel CDNs -->
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/react@18/umd/react.production.min.js" crossorigin></script>
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/react-dom@18/umd/react-dom.production.min.js" crossorigin></script>
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/@babel/standalone/babel.min.js"></script>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-color: #4f46e5;
            --primary-hover: #4338ca;
            --bg-color: #f9fafb;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-main: #111827;
            --text-muted: #6b7280;
            --border-color: #d1d5db;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 2.5rem;
            border-radius: 1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 440px;
        }

        h1 { font-size: 1.875rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
        p.description { color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 2rem; }

        .form-field { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
        .checkbox-wrapper { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem; }
        .label-container { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }

        input[type="checkbox"] {
            margin-top: 0.25rem;
            width: 1.25rem;
            height: 1.25rem;
            accent-color: var(--primary-color);
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        label { font-size: 0.9375rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }
        .helper-text { font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 0.375rem; }

        button {
            width: 100%;
            background-color: var(--primary-color);
            color: white;
            padding: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        button:hover { background-color: var(--primary-hover); transform: translateY(-1px); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div id="root"></div>
    <script type="text/babel">
        const CheckboxField = ({ label, helperText, required }) => (
            <div className="form-field">
                <div className="checkbox-wrapper">
                    <input type="checkbox" id="consent" required={required} aria-describedby="helper" />
                    <div className="label-container">
                        <label htmlFor="consent">{label}</label>
                        <span id="helper" className="helper-text">{helperText}</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        );

        const App = () => (
            <div className="card">
                <h1>Get started</h1>
                <p className="description">Join our community today. Review our terms to continue.</p>
                <form onSubmit={(e) => { e.preventDefault(); alert('Success!'); }}>
                    <CheckboxField 
                        label="I agree to the Terms of Service"
                        helperText="Required to create an account and access features."
                        required={true}
                    />
                    <button type="submit">Create Account</button>
                </form>
            </div>
        );

        ReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById('root')).render(<App />);
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```
